<title>POLAND: ZASADA REVISES DOWN H1 NET LOSS.</title>
<headline>ZASADA REVISES DOWN H1 NET LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zasada SA final results for</p>
<p>the first six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						H1 96	  H1 95</p>
<p>    operating				7.62   vs   15.49</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   2.43   vs    6.13 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				 4.68   vs    3.48 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Sobieslaw Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>Earlier the company has reported its net loss at 5.2 million</p>
<p>zlotys an pre-tax loss at 0.5 million.</p>
<p>    net sales			    181.70   vs  126.02</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     160.21   vs   97.25</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.25   vs    2.65</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   6.16   vs    2.25</p>
<p>    financial costs		     16.22   vs   11.61</p>
<p>    investment			    22.64   vs   83.31</p>
<p>    depreciation			  16.27   vs   20.08</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
